    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 13 · Follow-up Engine\nDefault sequence from `settings.followup_sequence_minutes`: 15 min · 4 h · 24 h · 3 d · 7 d.\nStops for BOOKED / HUMAN / STOPPED / DISQUALIFIED, skips if the customer replied, defers outside 9:00–20:00 local.\nClaim-then-send: a follow-up row is marked before sending, so overlapping runs can never double-text.",
        "width": 600,
        "height": 260
      },
      "id": "0a49441e-f536-431d-9201-78d90ac8876f",
      "name": "Note 1",
